Package: openalexAPI
Title: Local OpenAlex-Compatible Web API over a Parquet Corpus
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Rainer M", "Krug", , "Rainer@krugs.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7490-0066"))
Description: Serves a local Parquet corpus of OpenAlex works through a web
    API that answers like the OpenAlex '/works' endpoint, so the same
    classic filter URLs, OQL (OpenAlex Query Language) and OQO (OpenAlex
    Query Object) queries, including 'group_by', can be run against local
    data. Queries are translated to OQO by the free OpenAlex '/query'
    endpoint and compiled locally to DuckDB SQL. A small static web page is
    included for running searches in the browser.
